#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:4 f0cba091ba3c4a26b0b39950c4cebf18
msgid "文件传输"
msgstr "File Transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:7 a8bd4d54a8fa4bfcbc9ac499148b201b
msgid "用户数据存储空间"
msgstr "User Data Storage Space"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:11 79f056fc4bbe49ee8be7eb5a25776a4a
msgid "在cnSRC上，系统根据使用模式为用户在共享文件系统上分配三种目录，分别是个人目录，项目目录和公共集群目录。"
msgstr ""
"On cnSRC, the system allocates three directories on the shared file system "
"according to usage modes: personal directory, project directory, and public "
"cluster directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:13 a99c6952cfdd4354b6220345db4f2f08
msgid "在实例或集群中，这三种目录所对应的路径不同，具体见下表："
msgstr ""
"In the instance or cluster, the paths corresponding to these three "
"directories are different, as shown in the following table:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 4d7d76a926374be28f17ff27f9a4c971
msgid "个人目录"
msgstr "Personal Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 41039dd53de240de82a8c5a986e0d545
msgid "项目目录"
msgstr "Project Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 4fadb630e8ab4325b862bb709362b637
msgid "公共集群目录"
msgstr "Public Cluster Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 1f720c3c23fb45b1b3dd2a5c7842a525
msgid "容器实例"
msgstr "Container Instance"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 78259366768a42df971b69616ce427a0
#: c10316bf33064fbdb21bbb20011f8e7d
msgid "/home/username"
msgstr "/home/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 c1144ac395ad4e12a20a82b04f901dbf
msgid "/group_homes/<project>/home/username"
msgstr "/group_homes/<project>/home/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 0d103117c2eb492c93a329c0906add42
msgid "/group_homes/public_cluster/home/username"
msgstr "/group_homes/public_cluster/home/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 a6d28271b6aa4758944f7d0c52f8482c
msgid "虚拟机实例"
msgstr "Virtual Machine Instance"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 6b184dc60b3f4398990bd567ce861863
msgid "/webdav/MyData"
msgstr "/webdav/MyData"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 84001c23f3f04d05863ce63d227eb206
msgid "/webdav/ProjectGroup(<project>)"
msgstr "/webdav/ProjectGroup(<project>)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 b83af2216a874d5c8842810676a0158f
msgid "/webdav/ProjectGroup(public_cluster)"
msgstr "/webdav/ProjectGroup(public_cluster)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 86737a2ca632465ca37458f1a4dbaf17
msgid "公共集群"
msgstr "Public Cluster"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 1a7556dff2df4ee2b00de7ab837ea049
msgid "/users/username"
msgstr "/users/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 778b8685da71440e8145245cd567a8b4
msgid "/groups/<project id>/home/username"
msgstr "/groups/<project id>/home/username"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 0cd97dd7ec2241888fd4910cbc07e8c1
msgid "Web文件管理"
msgstr "Web File Manager"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 c1cde9e7722b43dd979d4d30da90f33e
msgid "个人家目录"
msgstr "Home Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 375103c60b4949b2b099ad7a84c04ef2
msgid "项目组目录（选择相应项目组）"
msgstr "Project group directory (select the corresponding project group)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:1 79f2c00c5bf84ffbb58df1ec19bfe055
msgid "项目组目录（如有public_cluster选项）"
msgstr "Project group directory (if a public_cluster option is available)"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:27 cb96c3480bd84bccbb583d484d724d45
msgid "username请替换为自己的用户名（这个信息可以在“我的信息”-“基本信息”中查询）。"
msgstr ""
"change username to your own username (this information can be found in \"my "
"information\"-\"basic information\")."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:29 d223be57cbaa42af96485216d3009ad9
msgid "<project id>请替换为\"g+项目ID\"（项目基本信息中查询项目ID），例：项目ID为700008，则替换为“g700008”。"
msgstr ""
"change <project id> to \"g+project id\" (project id can be found in project "
"basic information), for example: if project id is 700008, then change it to "
"\"g700008\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:31 963aa25c6e7342a48602ba761e709180
msgid "<project>请替换为项目名（项目基本信息中查询。）"
msgstr ""
"change <project> to project name (can be found in project basic "
"information)."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:35 667bbfc2804a4166af0cb08f82e7da27
msgid "Web文件管理通过“个人家目录”和“项目组目录”切换数据位置。 页面顶部显示的是当前浏览位置，不应直接作为实例或集群中的文件系统路径使用。"
msgstr ""
"Use Web File Manager to switch between \"Home Directory\" and \"Project "
"group directory\". The path shown at the top of the page is the current "
"browsing location and should not be used directly as a filesystem path "
"inside an instance or cluster."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:40 dd024561129b49239b9f7cbcd31bdd70
msgid "Web文件管理与数据传输"
msgstr "Web File Manager and Data Transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:42 d2d17543012148c98aa754047edbbda0
msgid ""
"登录麒麟平台后，点击左侧菜单 **文件管理**，或直接打开 `文件管理页面 "
"<https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/File/>`__， 即可浏览目录、搜索文件、新建文件夹，以及上传和下载文件。"
msgstr ""
"After logging in to the Kylin platform, click **File Manager** in the left "
"menu, or open the `File Manager page "
"<https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/File/>`__, to browse directories, search "
"files, create folders, and upload or download files."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:47 5c6524d472c54303a960dd4cdad1573e
msgid "选择数据目录"
msgstr "Select a Data Directory"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:49 7709520440ae4ae5b9fb8ab5100f6400
msgid "**个人家目录**：点击此按钮返回个人存储空间，页面顶部显示 ``~/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Home Directory**: click this button to return to your personal storage. "
"The page header shows ``~/``."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:50 e38c58d881b1499c88e36f8d9abc150f
msgid ""
"**项目组目录**：展开下拉列表，选择需要访问的项目组。页面顶部显示对应的项目组目录， 例如 ``test_project/``；进入其 "
"``data`` 子目录后显示 ``test_project/data/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Project group directory**: expand the dropdown and select the project "
"group to access. The page header shows the corresponding project path, for "
"example ``test_project/``; after entering its ``data`` subdirectory it shows"
" ``test_project/data/``."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:53 508957861920480997a7a7abf0784045
msgid "操作前先核对页面顶部的路径，确保上传文件或新建文件夹的位置正确。 项目组目录的可选项以当前账号页面中显示的列表为准。"
msgstr ""
"Before any operation, check the path at the top of the page so uploads and "
"new folders go to the right place. Available project group directories "
"follow the list shown for the current account."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:56 0518d8d1277e4f8eb33699931c6b15de
msgid ""
"文件列表包含 **文件名**、**文件大小**、**上次修改时间** 和 **操作** 四列， 可通过名称旁的文件夹图标或文件图标区分目录和文件。"
msgstr ""
"The file list has four columns: **Name**, **Size**, **Last modified**, and "
"**Actions**. Use the folder or file icon next to the name to tell "
"directories from files."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:63 1613ea2ff2ef4b189889a2634de43647
msgid "文件管理中的目录切换、工具栏及文件列表"
msgstr "Directory switcher, toolbar, and file list in File Manager"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:63 41db8ad9314847b0b7f82894b2c7311e
msgid "项目组目录示例：顶部显示当前路径，下方为目录切换入口、工具栏和文件列表。"
msgstr ""
"Project group directory example: the current path is shown at the top, with "
"the directory switcher, toolbar, and file list below."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:66 b3f412c9bba04d66b45b45576d8afff3
msgid "浏览和搜索文件"
msgstr "Browse and Search Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:68 4a67c2af2cdc4197a6c6a1f478eeb21d
msgid "点击文件夹名称，进入该子目录；点击 **返回上一级** 返回父目录。"
msgstr ""
"Click a folder name to enter that subdirectory; click **Up one level** to "
"return to the parent directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:69 91cf29231df144ed9d60c1833434a5d7
msgid "在 **搜索文件** 输入框中输入文件名关键字，点击右侧放大镜按钮，筛选当前目录中的条目。"
msgstr ""
"In the **Search files** box, enter a filename keyword and click the "
"magnifier on the right to filter entries in the current directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:70 089ce05340484963a8ef2d98e5794e36
msgid "清空搜索框并再次点击放大镜按钮，可恢复当前目录的完整列表。"
msgstr ""
"Clear the search box and click the magnifier again to restore the full list "
"for the current directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:71 edcd84fcb89e45e59c91c5418205aa7b
msgid "文件较多时，使用列表底部的页码或左右箭头切换分页。"
msgstr ""
"When there are many files, use the page numbers or left/right arrows at the "
"bottom of the list to change pages."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:74 dc92c415227c45a187d866538b94fe4d
msgid "新建文件夹"
msgstr "Create Folder"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:76 49cb4f1d36874971ba4cf9744006bf8b
msgid "进入目标目录，点击工具栏中的 **新建文件夹**。"
msgstr "Enter the target directory and click **New folder** on the toolbar."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:77 3fd250c1a965474184f0f21b6ffbfa5e
msgid "在弹出的对话框中输入文件夹名称，点击 **OK**。"
msgstr "In the dialog, enter the folder name and click **OK**."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:78 ff4f735ce2e34babb399515fbb01b5fe
msgid "检查当前列表中是否出现新文件夹；如需放弃创建，点击 **Cancel** 或右上角关闭按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the new folder appears in the current list; to cancel, click "
"**Cancel** or the close button at the top right."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:81 3a845ab8e650458498f3b0ef58b69f7b
msgid "上传文件"
msgstr "Upload Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:83 19b6deb3f5b9494092b6aa7b2b76f625
msgid "进入需要保存文件的个人目录或项目组目录，点击工具栏中的 **上传文件**。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the home or project group directory where files should be saved, then "
"click **Upload** on the toolbar."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:84 f1d147a18fd24ace9c8d621d0d57b1c7
msgid "在弹出的对话框中，再次点击 **上传文件**，通过本地文件选择窗口选择文件。"
msgstr ""
"In the dialog, click **Upload** again and choose a file in the local file "
"picker."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:85 d5715f6315584c5fad6b6fee014b32a8
msgid "查看上传窗口中的状态及提示，按界面提示完成操作并关闭窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Watch the status and messages in the upload window, follow the on-screen "
"prompts, then close the window."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:86 4411e2714bf0486aa235b5c365c59d2f
msgid "回到文件列表，核对文件名和文件大小，确认文件已出现在预期目录。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the file list and verify the filename and size to confirm the file"
" is in the expected directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:92 fa465f6912d94ea4898adb15c422c2dd
msgid "Web文件上传对话框，包含上传文件、Cancel和OK按钮"
msgstr "Web file upload dialog with Upload, Cancel, and OK buttons"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:92 3f5b96c6efe046b984604fa25ce5aec0
msgid "上传文件对话框；其中的“上传文件”按钮用于选择本地文件。"
msgstr "Upload dialog; the \"Upload\" button is used to select a local file."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:96 02737798c4c6438da8f58e5836f8f9cd
msgid "当前上传窗口的文件选择控件每次只允许选择一个本地文件，多个文件需逐个操作。 文件大小或数量限制、失败原因以实际上传时的平台提示为准。"
msgstr ""
"The file picker in the current upload window allows only one local file at a"
" time; upload multiple files one by one. Size/count limits and failure "
"reasons follow the platform messages shown during upload."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:100 c1bbba893a1c4ddd95cc27ccca5aa0ed
msgid "下载文件"
msgstr "Download Files"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:102 b84b2e09819f4ed58bac19f0c74c0a29
msgid ""
"进入文件所在目录，点击文件名称下载，并在浏览器中查看下载进度和保存位置。 文件夹名称用于进入目录；如需传输整个目录，可使用下文介绍的SSH传输方式。"
msgstr ""
"Enter the directory that contains the file, click the filename to download, "
"and check progress and save location in the browser. Folder names open "
"directories; to transfer a whole directory, use the SSH methods described "
"below."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:106 4f52d87325f642d68d34b967b775ca07
msgid "删除与操作注意事项"
msgstr "Deletion and Operation Notes"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:108 299abc94f6ed4c78991c6371921562e9
msgid ""
"文件列表 **操作** 列中的红色 **×** 为删除入口。 删除前应核对当前目录和目标名称，并提前备份重要数据； "
"项目组目录中的操作还需确认不会影响其他成员使用的数据。"
msgstr ""
"The red **x** in the **Actions** column deletes an item. Before deleting, "
"verify the current directory and target name, and back up important data; in"
" a project group directory, also confirm you will not affect data used by "
"other members."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:114 0bd9d5491d904020b68fc34a4a3537fc
msgid ""
"不要随意删除或覆盖个人目录中的配置文件（例如 ``.bashrc``、``.ssh`` 中的文件）。 "
"上传失败或文件未出现在列表中时，先检查当前路径、搜索条件、网络连接和页面错误提示， 确认原因后再重试，避免重复传输或误操作。"
msgstr ""
"Do not casually delete or overwrite configuration files in your home "
"directory (for example files under ``.bashrc`` or ``.ssh``). If an upload "
"fails or a file does not appear in the list, first check the current path, "
"search filter, network connection, and page error messages, then retry after"
" you understand the cause to avoid duplicate transfers or mistakes."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:119 768b9539d4394190889c96e5b28a27d8
msgid "通过ssh账户传输"
msgstr "transfer through ssh account"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:123 91c767bc2b124d6689f8b06787c0914a
msgid "由于Web传输文件功能有限，对于开放了SSH端口的集群或实例，用户可以通过SSH账户使用scp类的工具来传输数据。"
msgstr ""
"Because the web file transfer function is limited, for the cluster or "
"instance with open SSH port, users can use scp tools to transfer data "
"through SSH account."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:125 2191ac3b142549af97f502f0d68925dc
msgid "|image4|"
msgstr "|image4|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:175 cb3f3c9c2c2f45f79798d13e37c57946
#: edfeb8755abe43258ef0004618698b7b
msgid "image4"
msgstr "image4"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:127 82df02eec73d4faea82704ee5a5d2296
msgid ""
"以公共集群项目为例，用户在 **项目** -> *public cluster* 的页面里，选择 **实例** "
"，点击实例最右侧的SSH服务地址按钮，会弹出cnSRC对外开放的IP地址和端口："
msgstr ""
"Using the public cluster project as an example, on the **Project** -> "
"*public cluster* page, select **Instance**, click the SSH service address "
"button at the far right of the instance, and cnSRC will display the "
"externally accessible IP address and port:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:129 24d916c601a34977a724f606fa09d967
msgid "|ssh ip|"
msgstr "|ssh ip|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:131 2d610e3304f0419f9ccad42f6c4ff52b
#: 684552dfdc804a8eb32d73f240d8bf5c
msgid "ssh ip"
msgstr "ssh ip"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:134 1bbbc9adaba846f19b50275ff48ed9e9
msgid "首次使用SSH登录的用户需要 :ref:`重置cnSRC密码 <reset password>`"
msgstr ""
"Users logging in via SSH for the first time need to :ref:`reset their cnSRC "
"password <reset password>`"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:136 048a9b78f4ac4803ae8157dc59fe3c0f
msgid "|reset_pw|"
msgstr "|reset_pw|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:177 b8cee9ffe805407588a300d303ebfd08
#: c7aa8f8c17124de1b4d3e3a2ba57786e
msgid "reset_pw"
msgstr "reset_pw"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:138 4f5603a82365450a9604d977133e1097
msgid ""
"用户在能够直接访问cnSRC服务IP地址的情况下，可以使用scp、\\ `WinSCP "
"<https://winscp.net/eng/docs/lang:chs>`__\\ 或\\ `Xmanager "
"<https://www.netsarang.com/en/xmanager/>`__\\ 等scp工具来传输数据："
msgstr ""
"When users can directly access the cnSRC service IP address, they can use "
"scp, \\ `WinSCP <https://winscp.net/eng/docs/lang:chs>`__\\ or \\ `Xmanager "
"<https://www.netsarang.com/en/xmanager/>`__\\ and other scp tools to "
"transfer data:"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:145 0ce8b9b2476b4867856e7a3b41906c78
msgid "使用XFTP传输"
msgstr "Transfer with XFTP"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:147 fcd5457ec6cd4f17b6ec85386700803e
msgid "Windows用户也可以使用\\ `XFTP <https://www.xshellcn.com/xftp.html>`__\\ 客户端进行传输。"
msgstr ""
"Windows users can also use \\ `XFTP "
"<https://www.xshellcn.com/xftp.html>`__\\ client for transmission."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:149 f9962fc4c4a549059fafd39726448924
msgid "下载并安装XFTP软件后打开，点击“文件”-“新建”。"
msgstr "Download and install XFTP software, open it, click \"file\"-\"new\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:151 01a615c6f28e45abbfa7bbf0a2a8df8c
msgid "|new xftp connection|"
msgstr "|new xftp connection|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:153 3225a5c54bad46a9b02ce10043fd2c2f
#: 377c5aaf06f145a499930b9111988005
msgid "new xftp connection"
msgstr "new xftp connection"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:155 2a644845145c43a8864160fbe019405c
msgid ""
"名称用户可以自定义，主机选项中输入“服务ssh“显示的服务外部地址，端口号填写“服务ssh”中的端口号，协议使用默认的SFTP，用户名和密码填写cnSRC的用户名和密码。点击”连接“。"
msgstr ""
"You can customize the name. In the host field, enter the external service "
"address shown under \"Service SSH\"; enter the port number from \"Service "
"SSH\"; use the default SFTP protocol; enter your cnSRC username and "
"password. Click \"Connect\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:157 e2fa551272854bf28491d94af5865c4f
msgid "|set xftp connection|"
msgstr "|set xftp connection|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:159 8900191aa0804a4bbf9699062e227fe6
#: ada62217d3c34b26b7ec40f4b6ba75e7
msgid "set xftp connection"
msgstr "set xftp connection"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:161 aa2710c8a9634619bacec5e59cd792eb
msgid ""
"连接后左侧为当前用户计算机的视图，右侧为远程计算机的视图，用户访问的远程计算机路径为\\ ``/home/username``\\ "
"，即当前用户的家目录，用户可将文件从个人电脑上传输到共享文件夹内，下方传输栏会显示传输任务详细信息。"
msgstr ""
"After connection, the left side is the view of the current user's computer, "
"and the right side is the view of the remote computer. The remote computer "
"path accessed by the user is \\ ``/home/username``\\ , which is the home "
"directory of the current user. The user can upload files from the personal "
"computer to the shared folder, and the transmission bar below will display "
"the detailed information of the transmission task."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:163 627fed3f3d124eaaac62aa33cd8b446f
msgid "|xftp windows|"
msgstr "|xftp windows|"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:165 c6431db0ab5645cab73a71f117739f6c
#: d782ba22a8274e23815d30d8866490fd
msgid "xftp windows"
msgstr "xftp windows"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:167 379f31d0988d46f4bcd18c3a2158030e
